## Usage Examples

### In Value Objects (invariants in factory)

```java
// src/main/java/com/example/shared/domain/valueobjects/PositiveNumber.java

public class PositiveNumber {

    private final int value;

    private PositiveNumber(int value) {
        this.value = value;
    }

    public static PositiveNumber create(int value) {
        if (value <= 0) {
            throw DomainError.validation("Quantity must be positive");
        }
        return new PositiveNumber(value);
    }

    public int value() {
        return value;
    }
}
```

### In Entities (invariants in factory or methods)

```java
// src/main/java/com/example/orders/domain/Order.java
public class Order {

    private OrderStatus status;

    public void addItem(Product product, PositiveNumber quantity) {
        if (status != OrderStatus.DRAFT) {
            throw DomainError.validation("Cannot modify a confirmed order");
        }

        // ... add item
    }
}
```

### In Use Cases (not found)

```java
// src/main/java/com/example/orders/application/CreateOrderUseCase.java

public class CreateOrderUseCase {

    private final ProductRepository productRepository;

    public CreateOrderUseCase(ProductRepository productRepository) {
        this.productRepository = productRepository;
    }

    public OrderDTO execute(String productId) {

        Product product = productRepository.findById(Id.create(productId))
                .orElse(null);

        if (product == null) {
            throw DomainError.notFound("Product " + productId + " not found");
        }

        // ... create order
        return new OrderDTO();
    }
}
```

